            "auth": {
              "type": "apikey",
              "key": "x-api-key",
              "value": "{{x-api-key}}",
              "placement": "header"
            }
          },
          "docs": ":::note\nThis feature is only available in Preview to select customers on our Enterprise plan. [Contact us](mailto:team@supaglue.com) for more information.\n:::\nRegisters a custom property in Supaglue.\nThis may be useful for custom properties that were already created in the Customer's provider.\nE.g. a custom field has some machine ID for a particular customer that you want to map to `my_custom_field`.\n"
        }
